	(text "AUX header J9. Holes at 2.54 mm. Two uses:\nT14 mouse keys: keys 1 to 3 on pins 1 to 3, GND on pin 5.\nLegion Go fingerprint sensor: pin 1 WAKE, pin 2 RST,\npin 3 sensor TX, pin 4 sensor RX, pin 5 GND, pin 6 VIN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
